:"served:multiple_choice[4].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"綠色賽事主要是活動後做好垃圾分類","n":16,"ssz":"................"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[4].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"運動賽事應改用再生材料製作紀念品","n":16,"ssz":"................"},{"section":"served:reading_benchmark.levels[0].threshold","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"＜220字","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:reading_benchmark.levels[0].feedback","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"還要多加練習。","n":7,"ssz":"......."},{"section":"served:reading_benchmark.levels[1].threshold","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"221~250字","n":8,"ssz":"........"},{"section":"served:reading_benchmark.levels[1].feedback","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"嗯，還不錯喲！","n":7,"ssz":"...1..."},{"section":"served:reading_benchmark.levels[2].threshold","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"＞251字","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:reading_benchmark.levels[2].feedback","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"哇嗚，超級厲害！","n":8,"ssz":"........"},{"section":"served:key_reading.instruction","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"請用計時器，從指定段落（五    )開始朗讀，計時1分鐘讀的字數，並記錄在表格中。如果你計時3次後，對自己還不滿意，可以自己多練幾次喔。最後一次，找一位同學，請他來計時、記錄並簽名！","n":91,"ssz":"..................................................................1.......1................"},{"section":"served:key_reading.timing_table.columns[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"第1次計時","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:key_reading.timing_table.columns[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"第2次計時","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:key_reading.timing_table.columns[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"第3次計時","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:key_reading.timing_table.columns[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"裁判計時","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:key_reading.timing_table.unit","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"字","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:key_reading.benchmark_label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"◎ 我的表現","n":6,"ssz":"......"},{"section":"served:key_reading.passage#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"3.Recycle（回收再利用）：將使用過的材料回收處理，再製成新的材料或產品。舉例來說，許多賽事採用網路報名，不再印製賽事手冊，連完賽證書都能線上下載，減少紙張的使用；比賽紀念衫也改為自由選購，參賽者有需要再買，避免無謂浪費，這就是Reduce（減少使用）。再者，布置改用可保存、下次比賽還可以再用的器材或物品；比賽過程提供可重複使用的環保杯，讓參賽者「一杯用到底、杯杯不落地」，就是Reuse（重複使用）的實踐。此外，回收材料也開始在各種運動賽事中大放異彩。臺北馬拉松選用花蓮再生石材，新竹城市馬拉松以回收玻璃製作獎盃；世界盃足球賽中，也有許多國家球隊穿著以回收寶特瓶製成的環保球衣。這些都是Recycle（回收再利用）的展現。","n":316,"ssz":"........................................................1...........................................................................................................1.............2.......1............1...................................................................................................................."},{"section":"served:key_reading.start_text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"打造「綠色賽事」，可以從落實「環保3R」做起：\n","n":24,"ssz":"........................"},{"section":"served:text_type","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"單","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.answer_carrier","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"橘色手寫字為主（【　】內的 A/B/C 與 ①②③），另有 **2 個**紅色 ☑\n（w:sym Wingdings F0FE）在「二-1-2」與「二-(二)」兩道單選，PDF p6~p7 可見。","n":98,"ssz":".................................................................................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.answer_carrier#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"橘色手寫字為主（【　】內的 A/B/C 與 ①②③），另有 **2 個**紅色 ☑","n":41,"ssz":"........................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.answer_carrier#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"（w:sym Wingdings F0FE）在「二-1-2」與「二-(二)」兩道單選，PDF p6~p7 可見。","n":56,"ssz":"........................................................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"課文中的綠色賽事，用3R改變物品和材料的使用方式，減少對環境的負擔。\n真正落實3R，不只是知道三個R的意思，還要學會：\n①找出問題 → ②想3R改善方法 → ③檢查問題有沒有改善\n3R小提醒：\nA. Reduce（減少使用）\nB. Reuse（重複使用）\nC. Recycle（回收再利用）","n":145,"ssz":"................1...............................1...2.....................................................................1......................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"課文中的綠色賽事，用3R改變物品和材料的使用方式，減少對環境的負擔。","n":34,"ssz":"................1................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"真正落實3R，不只是知道三個R的意思，還要學會：","n":24,"ssz":".............1...2......"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"①找出問題 → ②想3R改善方法 → ③檢查問題有沒有改善","n":29,"ssz":"............................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"3R小提醒：","n":6,"ssz":"......"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"A. Reduce（減少使用）","n":15,"ssz":"..............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"B. Reuse（重複使用）","n":14,"ssz":".........1...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"C. Recycle（回收再利用）","n":17,"ssz":"................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"一、從生活中辨認3R","n":10,"ssz":".........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"下面三種做法，主要運用哪一個R？(請填入A、B或C)","n":26,"ssz":".............1............"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].columns[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"生活中的做法","n":6,"ssz":"......"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].columns[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"主要運用哪個R？","n":8,"ssz":".....1.."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].answer_carrier","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"橘色手寫代號（PDF p5）；文字層的【　】內已填有同樣的代號","n":31,"ssz":"..............................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].rows[0].生活中的做法","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"①能看電子資料時，就不另外列印紙本。","n":18,"ssz":"..........1......."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].rows[1].生活中的做法","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"②哥哥在二手網站購買仍可使用的家電","n":17,"ssz":"..1.............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].rows[2].生活中的做法","slug":null,"idx":null,"te